  "releaseNotes": "The user editor in User Manager gets a Roles tab with a switch, an optional start and expiry date, and a search box for every role. Debug builds add Switch User and Simulate Login, and new `EmApp` properties separate showing debug features from skipping permission checks. Tab titles in the multi-tab window are no longer cut off when a tab is selected.\n\nFull release note: https://github.com/MatrixCode-ID/em-system/blob/v0.1.0-alpha.6/doc/ReleaseNote/EmSys.Ui.Wpf.Core/0.1.0-alpha.6.md",
